WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.200
One decision model, three games.

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.000
Random policy vs the trained scorer. Same seeds. Recorded replay.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Snake 8×8 — random, then the model.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
DoorKey-5x5, fully observed — random fails; the model often reaches the goal.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
MinAtar-style Breakout — structured channels, not raw RGB.
